Pov
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
ZUBAQ 10 FACE_HALF

IVIP 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

HUIFU 4 FACE_ALL
HUIFU 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
HUIFU 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
HUIFU 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
HUIFU 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
HUIFU 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE {IVIP, HUIFU, ZUBAQ} IVIP
DESTSRC Rank equal
$win
OR
    PILE ALL IVIP Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL IVIP Empty
        PILE ALL ZUBAQ Empty
